<title>USA: Smithfield meat results under pressure.</title>
<headline>Smithfield meat results under pressure.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smithfield Foods Inc said Tuesday fresh meat results in the fourth quarter were disappointing and continue to be under pressure in May.</p>
<p>The company said it cited a lack of discipline in the pork processing industry as several major industry companies in the Midwest have not reduced their slaughter capacities, leaving too much capacity for too few hogs.</p>
<p>Until capacity comes into line with the reduced supply of hogs, fresh meat results will continue to suffer, it said.</p>
</text>
